{"product_id":"weapons-of-war-modern-fighter-aircraft-1945-present","title":"Weapons of War Modern Fighter Aircraft 1945-Present","description":"Part of the Weapons of War series, this book features more than 150 color and black \u0026amp; white illustrations and photographs as well as detailed specifications about modern fighter aircrafts used from 1945 to the present.Modern Fighter Aircraft brings together the most important fighters since the end of World War II in a single, handy volume arranged in alphabetical order. The book includes modern greats such as the F4 Phantom, Sukhoi Su-30, Eurofighter Typhoon, and F-15E Eagle.Features 150 entries of the most important weapons of the era Every weapon is illustrated with an accurate color artwork Each entry includes a specifications table with essential information such as armament, weight, speed, and range Concise text provides a summary of the design, development, service history, and performance of each weapon\nDimensions: 181 x 219\nAuthor: Chris Chant\nISBN: 9780785829966\nFormat: Hardcover\nPages: 176","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45721448939673,"sku":"15RC-4-9780785829966","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c7ba32b612f_Weapons_of_War_Modern_Fighter_Aircraft_1945-Present_Chris_Chant.jpg?v=1757931433","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/weapons-of-war-modern-fighter-aircraft-1945-present","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}